  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">秋</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">卉均</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi5eSpGpyFTGc0665AG_4lz55aG8mtjpSo337gHXW4ktdmfQRsdiwfqwir4zNvHhQeUrbyu2YZ9uUqCxIJBltNlqg6TpM_bHUz-_1OLEbr_Bl2SaSsGQ-VZF9pgdH8YZwYdwO_qxfSWjl1yFwk44U8L_-yuI8vIQ7wf8D-TGfPD1wgh_qvQBbz_MVrlrxTM\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi5eSpGpyFTGc0665AG_4lz55aG8mtjpSo337gHXW4ktdmfQRsdiwfqwir4zNvHhQeUrbyu2YZ9uUqCxIJBltNlqg6TpM_bHUz-_1OLEbr_Bl2SaSsGQ-VZF9pgdH8YZwYdwO_qxfSWjl1yFwk44U8L_-yuI8vIQ7wf8D-TGfPD1wgh_qvQBbz_MVrlrxTM=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">近來北部ê朋友lóng ē感覺天氣愈來愈秋凊，真正感受著秋天ê氣味，bē像熱天hōo人熱kah tsih載bē tiâu--ah！攑頭看著天頂ê雲尪恬恬仔tuè風leh跳舞，有沓沓仔se̍h ê芭蕾；mā有跳緊緊ê tshiah-tshiah；koh有khuann-khuann仔徙ê蓮花步，tī藍色ê天頂結白棉仔花，實在有夠suí。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">莫怪日本ê Ghibli（ジブリ，『吉卜力』）ē想像雲尪內底有一个「天空之城」，雖bóng lán lóng知影雲kan-na是一種水氣，內面啥mi̍h to無，不而過人對未知ê mi̍h件lóng有tsiânn濟想像力，想講雲內底iáu-koh有另外一个世界。就親像海底lán人無法度到位ê所在就有「Atlantis」（『亞特蘭提斯』），雲尪後壁有「天空之城」。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有時仔看雲勻勻仔行，感受風微微仔吹，鼻著桂花文雅ê芳味就ē-tàng慢慢tshiau揣時間ê影跡，莫怪人講時間是上好ê藥仔，m̄管啥mih代誌，ná像時間一下久就ē淡薄仔放bē記--得--ah……歡喜--ê、快樂--ê、悲傷--ê、艱苦--ê，lóng ē tuè時間沓沓仔退色--去。行過落葉ê塗跤，聽著一葉一葉ê樹葉聲，有tang時仔一tsūn風聊聊仔吹--來，koh ē hōo人心涼脾土開，tsit種恬靜時光mā hōo人幸福ê滋味。&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán ài珍惜現此時，因為人講料想bē到ê代誌kah明仔載ê日頭，佗一个先到，lán永遠to m̄知影。昨hng已經過--去--ah；明仔載mā iáu未到，lán ē-tàng la̍k tī手--裡--ê kan-na有眼前。時間對每一个人lóng tsiânn公平，不管有錢人散赤人lóng仝款有24點鐘，就án-ne lán m̄-tsiah ài珍惜時間、寶惜眼前。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"sepa